    <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow center">Step by step</p>
      <h2>How the process works</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">1</div><h3>Get in touch</h3><p>Tell me about the trip you're dreaming of by email, contact form or social media, and ask me all your questions.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">2</div><h3>Travel questionnaire</h3><p>A short questionnaire to understand your project: dates, destinations, activities, budget, travelers and preferences.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">3</div><h3>Discovery call</h3><p>Free and no obligation. We talk through your needs, and I explain my services and packages.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">4</div><h3>Itinerary &amp; quote</h3><p>I put together a first version of your tailor-made itinerary, based on your requests and your budget.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">5</div><h3>Trip design</h3><p>Once the quote is confirmed, I research, compare and put together a selection of the best accommodation and transport options for each stop.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">6</div><h3>Bookings</h3><p>Time to book: using my selection of accommodation and transport, you make your own bookings through the direct links I provide. You stay in control and free to choose.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">7</div><h3>Travel journal</h3><p>You receive your complete travel journal: all your bookings in one place, day-by-day activity suggestions, and all the local info and tips you need to enjoy your trip with total peace of mind.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-item" data-reveal><div class="tl-dot">8</div><h3>Off you go!</h3><p>Enjoy, stress-free. Have a question during your trip? I'm available on WhatsApp 7 days a week.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

